<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in"><B>20.&nbsp;APPLICABLE
LAW AND CONSENT TO JURISDICTION</B>. This Agreement and the legal relations among the parties shall be governed by, and construed and
